WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.868
-Of course, Thanksgiving
isn't just about food.

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:05.534
It's all about posting pictures
of your food on social media.

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:07.234
But there are some important
things to know

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:08.868
about posting
your Thanksgiving plate.

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:10.634
So I wrote a tiny song about it.

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:15.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:23.334
♪♪

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:27.267
♪ PSA, Thanksgiving food doesn't
photograph too good ♪

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:30.534
♪ It just looks like
a big old pile of beige ♪

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:32.968
♪ I'm sure your dinner
tasted great ♪

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:36.000
♪ But that tan rainbow on
your plate's not showing up on ♪

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.667
♪ No one's "For You" page ♪

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:40.968
♪ Mystery scoops of
brown and white ♪

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:43.701
♪ Gravy filmed by candlelight
ain't the look ♪

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:46.534
♪ That home cooking deserves ♪

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:50.100
♪ Hashtag dinner,
hashtag snacky ♪

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.367
♪ All looks like you serve
wet khakis ♪

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:55.934
♪ Bowls of soggy burlap
for dessert ♪

00:00:55.934 --> 00:01:00.300
♪ So PSA, Thanksgiving food
doesn't photograph too good ♪

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:03.901
♪ In worst-case scenarios
looks gross ♪

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:07.567
♪ Just take a picture with your
fam or your friends together ♪

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.033
♪ Not of ham ♪

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:13.067
♪ That's why your mom told you
to wear nice clothes ♪

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:17.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:22.133
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:23.133
Thank you.

